MALL MENU LOGIC FLOW

1. START / DISPLAY MALL INFORMATION
------------------------------------

START
  ↓
Receive Username + Selected Mall ID
  ↓
Read malls.txt
  ↓
Find Selected Mall
  ↓
Get:
• Mall Name
• Capacity
• Pricing Type
  ↓
Read parking_records.txt
  ↓
Count Currently Parked Vehicles
  ↓
Calculate Available Spaces
  ↓
Display:
• Mall Name
• Current Vehicles
• Maximum Capacity
• Available Spaces
• Pricing Type
  ↓
Display Mall Menu
  ↓
Enter Menu Choice


2. MENU INPUT
-------------

Enter Menu Choice
  ↓
Is input numeric?
  │
  ├── NO → Display Error
  │          ↓
  │      Return to Menu
  │
  └── YES
        ↓
   Convert input to integer
        ↓
   Is choice between 1 and 6?
        │
        ├── NO → Display Error
        │          ↓
        │      Return to Menu
        │
        └── YES
              ↓
        Process Selected Option


3. OPTION 1 — ENTER PARKING
----------------------------

Enter Parking
  ↓
Read parking_records.txt
  ↓
Find Highest Record ID
  ↓
Generate New Record ID
  ↓
Check Available Spaces
  │
  ├── NO SPACES
  │      ↓
  │   Display "Parking Unsuccessful"
  │
  └── SPACES AVAILABLE
         ↓
    Check Existing Parking Records
         ↓
    Is User Already Parked
    at This Mall?
         │
         ├── YES → Display
         │          "You are already parked"
         │
         └── NO
               ↓
          Create Parking Record
               ↓
          Save Record to parking_records.txt
               ↓
          Display "Parking Successful"
               ↓
          Return to Mall Menu


4. OPTION 2 — EXIT PARKING
---------------------------

Exit Parking
  ↓
Read parking_records.txt
  ↓
Search for Active Record
  ↓
Does record match:
• Current Username
• Selected Mall
• Empty Exit Time?
  │
  ├── NO → Display
  │        "You are not currently parked"
  │
  └── YES
        ↓
   Get Current Exit Time
        ↓
   Convert Entry Time to Datetime
        ↓
   Convert Exit Time to Datetime
        ↓
   Calculate Parking Duration
        ↓
   Calculate Complete Hours
        ↓
   Is There a Partial Hour?
      │
      ├── YES → Add 1 Billable Hour
      │
      └── NO → Use Complete Hours
        ↓
   Send Mall ID + Billable Hours
   to Pricing Function
        ↓
   Calculate Parking Fee
        ↓
   Update Parking Record
        ↓
   Add Exit Time
        ↓
   Add Calculated Fee
        ↓
   Write Updated Records
        ↓
   Display "Exited Parking Successfully"
        ↓
   Return to Mall Menu


5. OPTION 3 — VIEW PARKING FEE
-------------------------------

View Parking Fee
  ↓
Read parking_records.txt
  ↓
Search Parking Records
  ↓
Does record match:
• Current Username
• Selected Mall
• Completed Session?
  │
  ├── NO → Check Next Record
  │
  └── YES
        ↓
   Display Parking Fee
        ↓
   Check Next Record
        ↓
   Return to Mall Menu


6. OPTION 4 — MAKE PAYMENT
---------------------------

Make Payment
  ↓
Read parking_records.txt
  ↓
Find Completed Parking Record
  ↓
Does record match:
• Current Username
• Selected Mall
  │
  ├── NO → Display
  │        "No outstanding parking fee found"
  │
  └── YES
        ↓
   Store Record ID + Fee
        ↓
   Read payments.txt
        ↓
   Does Payment Already Exist
   for This Record ID?
        │
        ├── YES → Display
        │          "You have already paid"
        │
        └── NO
              ↓
         Find Highest Payment ID
              ↓
         Generate New Payment ID
              ↓
         Get Payment Timestamp
              ↓
         Create Payment Record
              ↓
         Save Payment to payments.txt
              ↓
         Display "Payment Successful"
              ↓
         Return to Mall Menu


7. OPTION 5 — VIEW PARKING/PAYMENT HISTORY
-------------------------------------------

View Parking/Payment History
  ↓
Read parking_records.txt
  ↓
Find Records Belonging to Current User
  ↓
Display Parking Information:
• Record ID
• Username
• Mall ID
• Entry Time
• Exit Time
• Fee
  ↓
Read payments.txt
  ↓
Find Payment Matching Parking Record
  ↓
Payment Found?
  │
  ├── YES → Display:
  │          • Payment Status: PAID
  │          • Payment ID
  │          • Amount
  │          • Paid At
  │
  └── NO → Display:
           • Payment Status: NOT PAID
  ↓
Return to Mall Menu


8. OPTION 6 — RETURN TO DRIVER MENU
------------------------------------

Return to Driver Menu
  ↓
Display "Returning to Driver Menu"
  ↓
Exit Mall Menu
  ↓
Return to Driver Menu